From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dxva2: Monitor configuration API, processor ranges, decoder service.

The physical monitor functions hand out handles from a table for each
HMONITOR; the DDC/CI calls on them fail with ERROR_GRAPHICS_I2C_NOT_SUPPORTED
(no DDC/CI channel here), bad handles with
ERROR_GRAPHICS_INVALID_PHYSICAL_MONITOR_HANDLE and OPM with
ERROR_GRAPHICS_OPM_NOT_SUPPORTED, as on systems whose monitors do not answer.
The software video processor reports ProcAmp and filter ranges (E_INVALIDARG
for unknown ones), takes AYUV input and lists substream formats. The decoder
service has no decoder devices and delegates surface creation. Removes a
todo_wine of the dxva2 test.
